1. h4 d5 2. Rh3? { The rook looks active but the bishop on c8 sees all the way along the diagonal to h3. } 2... Bxh3 { Takes the rook for nothing but a bishop. } 3. gxh3 { White has lost a rook for a bishop and is down the exchange for no reason. } *
